@title Cedarwood Elementary Open House
@author Dr. Leonie Osei, Principal

Dear families, we are so glad you are coming. This guide sets out when and where the evening takes place, what happens and when, and what to bring if you are thinking about kindergarten.

# When and where
kpi Date | Thursday 2026-11-12 | 17:30 to 19:30
kpi Place | 410 Elm Street | main building

Please join us in the main building at 410 Elm Street. The schedule below shows what happens and when.

# Schedule
table = Time,What happens; 17:30,Welcome from the principal in the gym; 17:50,Classroom tours for groups of 8 families (about 30 minutes each); 18:30,Kindergarten information session in the library; 18:45,After-school program table in the cafeteria; 19:15,Closing words

# What to bring
If you plan to register for 2027-28 kindergarten, please bring:

- A birth certificate
- Proof of address
- Immunization records

Registration opens on 2027-01-12.

# Getting here
There is free parking in the Elm Street lot, which has 60 spaces. A free shuttle runs every 10 minutes from the Pine Street church lot. Childcare for siblings is offered in the music room.

# Questions
Call us on 555-0166 or write to office@cedarwood.example. We look forward to meeting you.
